  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre FIRE 285 is positioned as the balance point between power and maneuverability in the FIRE range. Featuring a 100 sq.in head, 285 g unstrung weight, 325 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern, it is designed for club competitors and improving players who want easier handling without giving up useful mass and shot penetration. X-DAMP technology reduces harmful vibration by approximately 36%, while the revised frame geometry and centralized weight distribution improve stability, power control and racquet-head acceleration.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre FIRE 285 是 FIRE 系列中兼顾力量与操控性的均衡型号，采用100平方英寸拍面、285克空拍重量、325毫米平衡点及16×19开放式线床。相比更轻的 FIRE 270，它拥有更好的击球厚重感与稳定性；相比 FIRE 300，则更容易挥动。X-DAMP 技术可减少约36%的有害震动，提升舒适性并降低手臂疲劳。拍框截面更加方正且整体薄约5%，重量分布也更加集中，从而提升稳定性、力量控制和拍头加速能力，非常适合俱乐部比赛球员及中高级进阶玩家。"
  },

